{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "bf7f4db1-3d6d-825e-a833-b2c2763f5cf2",
  "created_at": "2026-03-02T13:15:19-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sheila Lynch",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:11:45-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation Department, this is Beth. Happy Monday, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:11:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, hello, good afternoon. Pardon me, is this the right office for reserving the community room?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:11:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It sure is, I can help you with that. What are you thinking of using it for?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:12:05-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, it's a birthday party. Pardon me, I should say, it's my own birthday. I'll be sixty-five next month and my sister says I have to have a party, so here I am."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:12:18-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, how nice! Happy early birthday. Do you have a date in mind?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:12:24-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I was hoping for a Saturday afternoon. The second Saturday in April, if that's open. Pardon me, would that be the eleventh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:12:33-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me look at the calendar. The second Saturday would be the eleventh, yes. Hang on one second while I pull it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:12:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, take your time, dear. I'm in no hurry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:12:47-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the eleventh. It looks like the room is open in the afternoon right now. Nothing booked yet. About how many people are you expecting?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:12:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, maybe thirty? Thirty-five at the most. Pardon me, is that too many for the room?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:13:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that should be fine for a room like that. We do have tables and chairs you can use, too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:13:14-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's wonderful. And pardon me, could I ask what it costs? I should have asked that first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:13:22-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Totally fine. The rate depends on residency and how many hours you book. I don't want to quote you the wrong number off the top of my head, so I'll email... actually, let me mail you the rate sheet with the application. Or you can stop in and pick one up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:13:42-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I'd rather pick it up, I think. I'm going to the library anyway this week. Pardon me, I have a whole bag of books to return. They're weeks overdue, I'm embarrassed to say."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:13:56-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, don't be embarrassed, it happens to everybody. Honestly, they'll just be glad to get them back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:14:03-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's kind of you to say. I found them under the guest bed. Three of them, and one is a cookbook I never even opened."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:14:13-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the way it goes. So for the room, I can put a hold on the eleventh for you while you get the paperwork. Can I get your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:14:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's Sheila Lynch. L-Y-N-C-H."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:14:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Sheila. And a phone number in case we need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:14:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0155. Pardon me, did you get all that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:14:38-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I did. Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-five. I've got a tentative hold for Saturday the eleventh, afternoon. Come by the office with the application and we'll finalize it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:14:49-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, thank you so much, Beth. You've been very patient with me. Pardon me, what are your hours, so I don't come at a bad time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:15:00-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We're here weekdays during regular business hours. Anytime before the end of the afternoon is good. Just ask for me at the front."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:15:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Lovely. I'll do that. Thank you again, and have a nice afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:15:16-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Sheila. Enjoy that birthday!"
    }
  ],
